WEBVTT

00:00:02.000 --> 00:00:06.170
Tinndi e ɓeynguure jinnaaɓe. Ɗuum woni haala senoufu.

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:12.640
Nder jemma nder gariiri, Ziè mawɗo ɗon mooɓta balafon.

00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:18.714
Téné boo ɗon yaha. O yiɗi kuugal ngal ɓurɗum kooɗume nder duuniyaaru.

00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:37.012
Nder jemma go'o, muusikol feere ummi diga nder leɗɗe. Ɗuum ɓurii ɗi Zié waɗi. Bana non boo, ɓe ɓeydi.

00:00:44.000 --> 00:00:49.530
Téné ummi haa ɗon. O wurti nder kawtal maako, o yahdi to haala.

00:01:06.000 --> 00:01:09.360
E nder go'o, mawɓe ley leɗɗe ɓe ngaɗi bee lewru.

00:01:18.000 --> 00:01:23.834
Téné fuɗɗi nyaamugo, o waawataa daranaago. Mawɓe ɓeen mbi'i ɗum'en.

00:01:31.000 --> 00:01:35.202
O yejjiti koo ɗume: innde maako, inna maako, gariiri maako.

00:01:46.000 --> 00:01:48.160
Nde subaka, ɗerewol ngol walaa.

00:01:49.500 --> 00:01:51.926
Tinndi ! Ɓiɗɗo am boo walaa!

00:01:56.000 --> 00:01:57.680
Walaa goɗɗo yi'i mo?

00:01:58.500 --> 00:02:01.400
E nder jemma oo, mi nani yimɓe ɗon kolli nder lekki.

00:02:01.500 --> 00:02:02.668
Geniiji!

00:02:16.000 --> 00:02:20.704
En njahi haa ɓe ɗon ɗaɓɓa dozo'en, ɓe ɗon cembiɗina leɗɗe.

00:02:21.000 --> 00:02:23.640
Wurtinee yam ɓiɗɗo am debbo, torake.

00:02:24.000 --> 00:02:25.536
En njahi nder jemma.

00:02:30.000 --> 00:02:36.730
Joomiraawo boo ƴamɗini ko'e maako, o ummini mo. Nden dozo'en ndilli bee doggi maɓɓe.

00:02:52.000 --> 00:02:55.594
Ɓe ɗon yaha jemma fuu. Mbira'en ɗon nana leɗɗe.

00:03:05.000 --> 00:03:09.778
Nder yaasi, yimɓe ɗon maaro. Yimɓe ɓen ummii, ɓe ndilli.

00:03:27.000 --> 00:03:32.530
Jaagorɗo dozo ƴetti nyaamdu mum. Ɗuum woni ɓooyaare, nden koo ɗume ummi.

00:03:39.000 --> 00:03:41.400
A hokke ɓiɗɗo o'o to inna maako.

00:03:43.000 --> 00:03:46.600
Mawɗo ginnaaji'en duumii, sey o hooti.

00:03:50.000 --> 00:03:53.706
Jaɓɓorgo Fedde Ɓamtaare. O jeyaa to maaɗa.

00:03:56.000 --> 00:03:58.592
O acci mo to Tene, o ummi bana nder lekki.

00:04:12.000 --> 00:04:18.250
Nder juulde re'eteeɓe, Téné feewti balfon genius. Yimɓe nder gariiri ndin fuu mbi'i:
